<title>CHINA: China mobile phone users to top 10 mln by end-1997.</title>
<headline>China mobile phone users to top 10 mln by end-1997.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>China will have more than 10 million mobile phone users by the end of this year and 18 million by the year 2000, the Market Daily said on Monday.</p>
<p>The number of mobile phone users has surged in recent years, and that trend is expected to continue as living standards rise. The report did not give a current figure for mobile phone users.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
